{
  "title": "GitHub Copilot Token & CLI Usage (Detailed)",
  "uid": "copilot-token-usage-detailed",
  "tags": [
    "copilot",
    "tokens",
    "cli",
    "ai-credits"
  ],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 1,
  "style": "dark",
  "editable": true,
  "time": {
    "from": "now-60d",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "current": {},
        "datasource": {
          "type": "prometheus",
          "uid": "${DS_VICTORIAMETRICS}"
        },
        "definition": "label_values(github_copilot_enterprise_seat_total, enterprise)",
        "hide": 0,
        "includeAll": false,
        "label": "Enterprise",
        "multi": false,
        "name": "enterprise",
        "query": {
          "query": "label_values(github_copilot_enterprise_seat_total, enterprise)",
          "refId": "VarEnterprise"
        },
        "refresh": 1,
        "sort": 1,
        "type": "query"
      },
      {
        "current": {
          "selected": true,
          "text": "All",
          "value": "$__all"
        },
        "datasource": {
          "type": "prometheus",
          "uid": "${DS_VICTORIAMETRICS}"
        },
        "definition": "label_values(github_copilot_billing_day_marker{enterprise=\"$enterprise\"}, org)",
        "hide": 0,
        "includeAll": true,
        "allValue": ".*",
        "label": "Billing Orgs",
        "multi": true,
        "name": "org",
        "query": {
          "query": "label_values(github_copilot_billing_day_marker{enterprise=\"$enterprise\"}, org)",
          "refId": "VarOrg"
        },
        "refresh": 1,
        "sort": 1,
        "type": "query"
      }
    ]
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 500,
      "title": "How to read this dashboard",
      "type": "text",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "targets": [],
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${DS_VICTORIAMETRICS}"
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "## GitHub Copilot Token & CLI Usage\n\nTracks **enterprise-wide CLI token consumption**, **per-model prompt activity**, **chat mode usage**, and the **AI credit billing** tied to model usage.\n\n- Enterprise CLI metrics (`github_copilot_cli_*_tokens_sum`) come from the daily enterprise usage report's `totals_by_cli` block and represent aggregate token volume across all CLI sessions for the enterprise.\n- Per-model breakdowns (`github_copilot_user_model_feature_*`) are derived from per-user daily rows and reflect prompt counts and LOC by model+feature, not raw token counts (GitHub does not expose per-model token counts outside the CLI aggregate).\n- AI Credit billing by model gives the **cost** side of token-consuming models (Claude Opus, GPT, etc.) even where raw token counts aren't separately exposed."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 501,
      "title": "CLI Sessions (latest day)",
      "type": "stat",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 4,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 4
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "max_over_time(github_copilot_cli_session_count{enterprise=\"$enterprise\"}[1d])",
          "instant": true,
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${DS_VICTORIAMETRICS}"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "blue",
